      "content": "thanks. i'm seeing a lot of debate lately about whether these companies act as \"gatekeepers\" for smaller startups. some people say they're basically impossible to compete with because they control the platforms everyone else has to use. do you think those gatekeeper arguments are actually valid, or is it just a way to target successful companies?",
